      4					; HGX: mapped RT-11XM handler for the HC7000 host GPIO link.
      5					; Keep the released SJ/FB HG.MAC unchanged. Wire protocol is identical.
      6					; $GTBYT/$PTBYT resolve and advance the request buffer through RMON,
      7					; including PAR boundary carries; no user virtual address is dereferenced.
      8					; Byte helper contract: RT-11 Device Handlers Manual, section 1.10.4.
